Hi. This is a bug; I've created a ticket for it in GitHub here:
  https://github.com/zeligdev/ZeligCommon/issues/1

There will be a patch for this soon. Additionally, "relogit" is being moved to the Zelig core package in an upcoming patch.

- Matt
